- Added `_replace_stderr_clixml` to the import from 
`ansible.plugins.shell.powershell`

### 4. Updated `exec_command` method in 
`/app/lib/ansible/plugins/connection/ssh.py`
- Replaced the previous conditional parsing logic that only handled CLIXML 
starting with `b"#< CLIXML"`
- Now calls `_replace_stderr_clixml` on stderr when running on Windows
- This handles CLIXML blocks embedded anywhere in stderr, not just at the start

